OL,3,GNEWSABritish baseball champions crowned
OL,4,Aa century after win
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, a century on from the team's first
OL,7,Ftriumph, the championship has finally
OL,8,Fbeen certified by the British Baseball
OL,9,FFederation - with a plaque celebrating
OL,10,Fthe team recently unveiled at a local
OL,11,Fmuseum.
